#### 2. `org.w3c.dom.NamedNodeMap.getNamedItem()`

This method serves to retrieve a node specified by its name from a collection of nodes. It takes one parameter: the name of the node to be retrieved.

### Example Usage

Here's an example of how to use these methods to get the value of a specified XML attribute as an integer:

