3. `javax.swing.SwingUtilities.invokeLater()`: This method serves to ensure that any code executed on the AWT event dispatching thread is thread-safe and does not interfere with the GUI. In this case, it is used to execute the code that redirects the System Streams to a JTextArea, ensuring that it is executed on the correct thread.

