- `MBeanServerFactory.findMBeanServer()`: This method returns a list of registered MBeanServer objects. A registered MBeanServer object is one that was created by one of the createMBeanServer methods and not subsequently released with releaseMBeanServer. This part of the request serves to get all MBeanServers that are currently running.

