3. `DOMSource(xmlString)`: This method serves to create a DOMSource instance from the input XML string. It is used to provide the input to the Transformer instance.

4. `StreamResult(writer)`: This method serves to create a StreamResult instance that writes the output to the specified writer. It is used to capture the output of the Transformer instance.

5. `StringWriter`: This class serves to create a writer that can be used to hold the output of the transformation. It is used to capture the transformed XML as a string.

