This method serves to replace each substring of the input string that matches the given regular expression with the given replacement. In this case, the regular expression `(?<=\\D)(?=[A-Z])` matches any position that is preceded by a non-digit character (`\\D`) and followed by a capital letter (`[A-Z]`).

