- `Math.cos()`: This method serves to calculate the cosine of an angle. In the context of the cosine interpolation, it calculates the cosine of the position, which is used to determine the interpolated value.

- The `interpolate()` method serves to calculate the interpolated value based on the start value, end value, and position. It uses the `Math.cos()` method to calculate the cosine of the position and then applies it to the interpolation formula to get the final interpolated value.

